    {
      "id": "475cfc48-ea2b-4e5d-be07-92f4f6691a74",
      "title": "Escute, leia e observe a cena. Ligue a palavra em espanhol ao apoio em portugues.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "0eaba428-8d98-41fd-b697-8e24aa2758f0",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>derechos</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>direitos</strong></p><p>A cena ajuda a ligar a palavra ao que as pessoas podem pedir ou esperar de forma justa.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8ece559e5b8e4298b2650e7f62c0d102_l03b01-derechos.png?Expires=1794099663&Signature=TRA4I-4Y8fGawPh~P6~vi6J02nuCs020-2yBthkMZaS0rVRJrqnBYdLkMU69CYY1bhjgOdHP8mB7PkDTwl4fyv3ZW6IdywmC1IvIi-PDjZ~oKA3sjEpGYJ3-TfNHAEUmE1Y~ZgPJjcAfUJd-yIDZFRSixq5jKVTXY~-VDNQEn2QM4E~1Foz7rkHi9hVEXTcs3JiyPX-d6mDEUncGRpszsWdUhg1AzEtakAZexvchOtHDGCN0ap4wfNfqHUFNH4Iy-gC7xf6aRDh5G9f4yKRXgOBm1WsVH7dxdkZHijT64yuizY9zwwHjyv54QsksgYzWU7EtpUfyW5NERsHDQ1mAug__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
